    <p style="font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 4px;"><a href="https://clevelandculturalgardens.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #444; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid #E8E0D0;">Cleveland Cultural Gardens</a></p>
